WEBVTT

00:11:59.725 --> 00:12:02.736
inflict massive, massive risks
on the rest of us

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:04.677
and privatize the gains,

00:12:04.701 --> 00:12:06.768
becoming repulsively wealthy

00:12:06.792 --> 00:12:09.426
while they stuck us
with the $22 trillion bill.

00:12:10.723 --> 00:12:12.190
And more recently --

00:12:12.214 --> 00:12:14.444
(Applause)

00:12:14.468 --> 00:12:17.181
Are you the ones who have gotten
the thank-you letters?

00:12:17.205 --> 00:12:18.503
I'm still waiting for mine.

00:12:18.527 --> 00:12:21.283
I just figured they were
too busy to be grateful.

00:12:21.307 --> 00:12:23.243
And much more recently,

00:12:24.291 --> 00:12:27.603
online privacy started looming
as a huge issue,

00:12:27.627 --> 00:12:29.573
and we basically outsourced it.

00:12:29.597 --> 00:12:30.944
And once again: